{"step_index":539,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T23:51:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-29T17:51:26-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-29T17:51:29-06:00\nThe search for \"\"Pure fire of God\" site:cfcindia.com\" returned the following summary:\nThe phrase \"Pure fire of God\" appears in the lyrics of the hymn **\"Burn Fire of God\"** (often titled \"Burn Fire of God! My Ransomed Soul Possessing\"), which has been recorded at the Christian Fellowship Church (CFC) in Bangalore, India[1].\n\nThe specific line from the hymn is: **\"Pure fire Thou art, and I would dwell in Thee.\"**[1][2]\n\nWhile \"fire of God\" is a common theme in CFC teachings—often used to describe the baptism of the Holy Spirit, the purification of the believer, or God's presence[3][4][5][6]—the exact phrase \"Pure fire of God\" is most directly associated with this hymn[1].\n\nSources:\n[1] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH4JQ1RQs1qH0kTvWDAJIjsJ1RNtIUZdj9FvnPnevORxOL4mYhkTG--0jiluAggyu-Rhj3oF-CehwMmLKmbfGVxVjFDRdEziuMuWZvuuW0Li3-TlXYuZT7hQjduOy_lsyg=)\n[2] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH4JQ1RQs1qH0kTvWDAJIjsJ1RNtIUZdj9FvnPnevORxOL4mYhkTG--0jiluAggyu-Rhj3oF-CehwMmLKmbfGVxVjFDRdEziuMuWZvuuW0Li3-TlXYuZT7hQjduOy_lsyg=)\n[3] [cfcindia.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEwsXBuaKMOe59Ath6n5Hg4ayr4dkqNKkCGQIUjaBMFwsRqlD-0oUGVttxb0xVSpdxAaGX0QR9SB_HfnzsFhYWv6340oD1EyGpFN2bsRlbgTsNjS_lrkPqM7S6lO9Wc12n5nM8kwnGbCKFXdEmrh06o-wj0a5I=)\n[4] [cfcindia.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGgDF-Diu3WDVm2IzkF2O5_UNp82tnnK73kVRj6dPmQQmqTmfJCGIHNAYBcuQZWF_6eCO1zy7cHZy2u_uNzBmY0XIY5TMsxQqUKaYHkxG1U5PLYRkQUlpnqC5pRoQcwXsrkszF7UZIxp9Pq695DOLA=)\n[5] [cfcindia.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH2K15TlhxJSnuAzws6wUy0txQ90byzrBjhfpXic6uhSJrzD2m1JDeG5HMHu-SWr73eBY6fkmN